.arimo-alef-vf{
    font-family: 'AlefArimoVF';
}</code></pre>
<pre class="snippet-code-html lang-html prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;h3&gt;Static fonts&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class="arimo-alef"&gt;
  &lt;span&gt;Hello World&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span&gt; 
  שלום עולם
  &lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Variable fonts&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class="arimo-alef-vf"&gt;
